     Defaults for these variables can be set in sysctl.conf(5), which is
     parsed at boot-time.

CCOOMMPPAATTIIBBIILLIITTYY
     In order for aaccppii__vviiddeeoo to attach correctly, aaccppii__vviiddeeoo should be loaded
     after any of the DRM kernel modules.  This can be achieved by setting the
     correct order in rc.conf(5) using the kld_list directive.

